    "features": "<p>Veterans have been through the worst conflicts and survived to tell of it. If there was an order they couldn’t follow, they reinvented it in a way they could. They are the elite, the best, and expect no less from the soldiers under their command or the recruits they train. A few that fall out of their cause find work as mercenaries with a fearsome reputation.</p><p><strong>Favored Stunts:</strong> Bodyguard, Group Tactics, Long Burst, Skirmish, Short Burst</p><p><strong>Talents:</strong> Command (Expert), Improvisation (Expert), Inspire (Novice), Tactical Awareness (Master)</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> automatic rifle, pistol, grenades, hand terminal, medium body armor, tactical gear</p><p><strong>Armor + Toughness:</strong> 7</p>",
    "statBlockView": true
  },
